window.products.push({"id":809055,"name":"Stanley Heritage Insulated Food Jar for Kids (8 and Above) with Spork, 14oz Stainless Steel Kids’ Lunch Box, Dishwasher Safe and BPA-Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gFJM6UhTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE MEALS FUN: Bring along the deliciousness on your little explorer’s next adventure. Made with kids in mind, our 14oz Heritage food jar comes with enough space to fit all that scrumptious chow while still being compact for easy portability. And digging in will be a cinch. Every insulated food jar features a sturdy plastic spork for earth-friendly reusability. It fits into the bracket on the side of the insulated food container for secure attachment and easy accessibility SUPERIOR THERMAL RETENTION: Tasty soup or creamy mac ‘n’ cheese, yummy yogurt or mouthwatering meatballs, this insulated lunch box for kids keeps it delish. And it’s all thanks to the double-wall vacuum insulation that keeps food 7 hours hot and 7 hours cold. The insulation extends to the lid, which screws on tight to keep leaks at bay. When it’s time for lunch, the pressure-release valve on the lid makes unscrewing simple. So, little ones won’t struggle to fill their bellies DESIGNED TO LAST: No more constantly replacing cracked plastic lunch boxes for kids. Crafted from 18/8 stainless steel - the same tried & trusted material found in our iconic mugs and bottles - our rugged insulated food jar withstands the inevitable bumps and falls of kiddie life. It’s perfect for school lunches, camping trips, hikes, road trips, or wherever else the spirit of adventure takes you and your kiddo. And like all our legendary drinkware and food containers, this jar is BPA-free EASY TO CLEAN: Spend less time hunched over the sink and more time creating memories. Our leak-proof lunch containers are dishwasher safe to make cleaning a breeze. And when you’re out in the wild with no dishwasher in sight, the wide opening and smooth interior take the stress out of handwashing. The wide mouth also makes filling the thermal food jar faster and mess-free. So, you’ll have the power to send off your little one with a serving of chicken noodle soup in a fraction of the time BUILT FOR LIFE: Since 1913 we’ve promised to provide rugged, capable gear for food and drink - accessories built to last a lifetime. It’s a promise we still keep. Stanley products purchased from Stanley Resellers come with a lifetime guarantee. So, whether it’s an epic hiking adventure out in the wild, a family picnic at the park, or the day-to-day grind navigating the urban jungle, you can rest easy knowing we’ve got your back through it all","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gFJM6UhTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stanley","source_asin":"B0B816F34H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B816F34H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B816F34H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
