window.products.push({"id":809087,"name":"Mini Fridge Portable Thermoelectric Cooler and Warmer for Skincare, Eco Friendly Beauty Fridge For Foods,Medications, Cosmetics, Breast Milk, Medicati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RwW1eqG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH DESIGN: With stylish design compatible well with any decor of your room, perfect combination with other accessories. It is the perfect addition to any home or office and it is also great for taking out and about camping or travelling. Made from strong and durable food grade materials, the fridge is designed to last and look great at the same time. COOLING & WARMING: The Thermoelectric System in the Caynel mini fridge allows for easy switching from beverage cooler to food warmer! Easily choose to chill up to 45ºF or warm up to 140ºF - with the flip of a switch. Well insulated interior holds temperature even after unplugged. PORTABLE DESIGN: The mini fridge can be easily carried using. Ideal for home, car, caravan, boat, office, bedroom and perfect for picnics. It covers all your bases! AC and DC power cords are included for indoor or outdoor use. Easy to go from indoor 110V (AC) to car use by plugging the appliance into the car cigarette 12V (DC) adapter. ECO FRIENDLY & SAFE: 100% Freon-Free and Eco Friendly; approved with advanced safety technology for long lasting durability. The fridge features a brush-less high-grade fan motor with the ability to perform quieter and to last longer than ever before! SPECIFICATION & WARRANTY: Unit measures: 9.25\" L x 11.41\" W x 13.19\" H and weighs 8.3 lbs. The Inner dimensions: 7.16\" L x 6.69\" W x 10.9 \" H, Cooling Capacity: 40ºF-45ºF below ambient temperature, Warming Capacity: 122ºF-144ºF. ETL approved with advanced safety technology for long-lasting durability, 1-year hassle-free warranty provided by Caynel. For information on how to use your product, scroll down for a PDF user guide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RwW1eqG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAYNEL","source_asin":"B07ZNLRG9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZNLRG9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZNLRG9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":809088,"name":"Amalnairna Body Pillow Case Body Pillow Cover - Bamboo Cooling Breathable Body Pillowcase, Embroidery Silky Soft Pillow Case for Hot Sleepers, Night S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R+U8DkCvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐼 【All about Bamboo】Amalnairna bamboo body pillowcase is made of organic viscose from bamboo. Heathier than microfiber, softer and cooler than cotton, more affordable and durable than silk, bamboo viscose has recently taken the sustainable fashion bedding by storm. Along with bamboo's impressive growth capacity and speed, the bamboo is a renewable and eco-friendly resource. 🎋【Cooling and Breathable】Amalnairna soft body pillowcase is made with 250-thread count cellulose fiber from bamboo rayon which means it is very breathable and have tons of room for airflow. It's the perfect exclusive cool pillowcase for hot sleepers. The moisture wicking property of bamboo can help dissipate heat when you get too hot and prevent night sweats. Our bamboo pillowcase will definitely keep you fresh during summer days and cozy during winter days. 🎋【Skin and Hair Friendly】: Different from other bamboo plain weaves, our special twill wave leaves pillowcase feeling very silky and the antistatic performance is superior to satin material. If you struggle with frizziness and the bedhead, the ultra-smooth texture and moisture-retaining property of this pillowcase makes the hair slip and slide in your sleep. Its unbelievable silky softness makes it perfect for delicate skin. 🎋【Embroidery and Envelope Closure Design】: Our long pillow case has exquisite and delicate embroidery on it comeing out in a 3-dimensional way. It is colorfast, leading to rich and beautiful hues to suit any bedroom style. Soft and luxe, it has a gorgeous \"draping\" quality that gives it an elegant, flattering look. No zipper envelope design with a 7\" long fold-over, this specific design helps hold the pillowcase inside onto the body pillows and will prevent the pillow from slipping. 🎋【Safe and Easy to Use】: Our body pillow cover is made in OEKO-TEX Standard 100 factory, an independent certification system that ensures textiles meet high safety and environmental standards. You can sleep soundly knowing our body pillow case is safe for the whole family. Unlike other luxury fabrics, bamboo viscose is machine washable on the delicate cycle with cool water. Tumble dry on low. It is natural to have wrinkles after washing, iron on low heat if needed to get wrinkls out as new.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R+U8DkCvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amalnairna","source_asin":"B0B5NBBKD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5NBBKD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5NBBKD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
