window.products.push({"id":809139,"name":"MLILY Bliss+Gel Memory Foam Pillow Luxury Hypoallergenic Cooling Gel-Infused Bed Pillow Breathable Sweat Absorbent Pillow with Washable and Removable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cYgFFjxkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Description: Helps during tossing & turning, insomnia, migraines, lessens snoring. The pillow will help reduce neck pain while ensuring maximum comfort. Cloud-like softness, therapeutic pressure-relieving support and proper spine and neck alignment. Memory foam pillows provide an uninterrupted night's sleep every night. Characteristics: With both the gel and memory foam aligning with the contours of your neck and head, you will feel the pressure and strain on those parts of your body relax. The foam has ideal firmness and the depth is just right. It supports your neck while allowing your head to sink in just right so that your head doesn't feel too propped up like some fuller foam pillows. The pillow utilizes technology originally created by NASA, accommodates all sleeping positions and adapts to your unique weight, shape, and body temperature, ensuring your head, neck, and shoulders are supported throughout the night. Side, back and stomach sleepers will get the maximum comfort during all night. Help stop back & neck pain, tossing & turning, insomnia, migraines, snoring and orthopedic problems. The heat-dissipating gel and revolutionary cool-to-the-touch fabric! If you are searching for a pillow that would prevent you from overly sweating, here it is – one of the most advanced soft, silky cooling cover and gel fiber filling combination on the market today. The cool gel keeps the pillow from heating up and provides a cooler face with less interruption of sleep. It feels like you are laying on a cool yet firm pad. You will never have been suffering from night sweats with our pillow. Note: Washable in cold water under 30℃ . In case you experience an odor which is a \"Fresh Foam\" odor, it is not harmful. The odor should dissipate several days later after the pillow is unpacked and aired out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cYgFFjxkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MLILY","source_asin":"B07MH55FZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MH55FZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MH55FZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
