window.products.push({"id":809233,"name":"Floriogra Projection Alarm Clock FM Radio, Alarm Cock with Projection on Ceiling for Bedrooms 180° Rotatable Projector, USB Charging Port, LED Digital","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qzSiiqVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰PROJECTION ALARM CLOCK, WAKE UP IN STYLE: Projection & 180°Rotation: This alarm clock adopts a 180° (-90° to 90°) adjustable projection design, it can project the clear time onto the wall or ceiling within the distance range of 1.6-10ft. It's easy to read in bed at night. 📻15 RADIOS ALARM CLOCK WITH SLEEP TIMER: The radio clock alarm clock is specially designed for heavy sleepers and provides adjustable 15 levels of volume, easy to wake you up. Alarm clock radio can receive frequencies 76.0Mhz-108Mhz and store up to 15 radio stations for your use. The sleep timer function (5, 15, 30, 45, 60,75, 90 minutes) will turn off auto-off after the specific time you set. 🔔DUAL ALARM CLOCKS WITH TIMING SNOOZE: This projection alarm clock allows you to set two separate alarms easily especially for couples or families who keep different schedules or a backup for waking up heavy sleepers. The snooze button is in a convenient rightmost location to turn off the alarm to get extra sleep. NOTE: default snooze duration is 9 minutes, and the adjustable range is 5-60 minutes. 🔋USB CHARGER PORT & BACKUP MEMORY: With USB port will allow you to charge your phone or other devices while the clock occupies an outlet. Included memory batteries can remain clock time working normally and remember the original time/alarm/FM radio/snooze settings instead reset while in case of power failure. During the backup battery, the screen will go blank but the alarm will still be triggered. NOTE: the USB adapter is not included. 💡MULTI-FUNCTION CURVED SCREEN ALARM CLOCK: An integrated 7-inch curved surface takes you an incredible displaying experience and lets you read the time easily. You can choose from different Bright-Medium-Dim-Off brightness for the screen display or the projection. 12 or 24-hour system can be changed. We guarantee a 100% free lifetime warranty. Please feel free to contact us via Amazon if you have any problems with our projection alarm clock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qzSiiqVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Floriogra","source_asin":"B0BNZ5F5P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNZ5F5P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNZ5F5P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
