window.products.push({"id":809288,"name":"(200 Pack) 5ml Thick Amber Glass Jars with Black Child Resistant Lids - Tiny Storage for Oil, Wax, Cosmetic, Spices, & Accessories - Mini Child Proof ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v1E4GbBiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THICK BOTTOM UV-RESISTANT GLASS JARS: Our glass jars are designed with a thick bottom and made of premium quality glass that is resistant to UV rays. This feature ensures that your products are shielded from harmful light, allowing them to stay fresh and last for extended periods. CHILD-RESISTANT LIDS: The child-resistant push down and turn lid, featuring a sleek gloss design, provides added protection for your products, significantly reducing the likelihood of accidental spills or exposure. This feature ensures that your products remain intact and secure to use even in the hands of curious and adventurous children. With this innovative lid design, you can have peace of mind knowing that your products are well-protected. EASY TO PACK, STORE AND USE: These jars are designed with straight walls and wide mouths, which make them very easy to pack, store, and use for various products like oils, creams, cosmetics, lip balms, waxes and more. These jars are a great choice for those seeking convenience in storage and usage. VERSATILE STORAGE: The 5ml glass jars are a versatile storage option that can be used to store and showcase a variety of items. In addition to being great for organizing and displaying products, these jars can also be used in DIY projects or to create personalized blends. With their multi-functional design, these jars are a great addition to any home or workspace. LARGE QUANTITY FOR CONVENIENCE: Each set of glass jars includes 200 jars and 200 lids. This large quantity is great for businesses, artisans, and anyone who wants to have a convenient supply of glass jars on hand for their products or projects. The jars measure 1.0\" tall x 1.35\" wide (with lid on), making them excellent size for travel, sampling, or storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v1E4GbBiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SODO LOCO","source_asin":"B0BN4NJ3DB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN4NJ3DB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN4NJ3DB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
