window.products.push({"id":809429,"name":"Navy Classic Cultured Marble Cremation Urn for Ashes, Blue, Adult Sized Cremation Urn for Human Ashes, Ground Burial, Home Memorial and Funeral Cremat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":116.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51enk5UEYLL._AC_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE MEMORIAL URN: This urn can be kept at home or placed in a niche, but its sturdiness makes it an excellent choice for ground burial. Typically you do not need a separate urn burial vault (which could save you hundreds of dollars at the cemetery), although you should always check the cemetery regulations to confirm. This is an adult size urn. The dimensions of this cremation urn are: 9.75” L x 6.75\" D x 6.5\" H BEAUTIFULLY COLORED: This stately urn is dark blue with white marbling. It is made from a precise blend of crushed stone, resin, and color pigments with the highest quality standards to maintain the look of genuine stone. Honor your loved one with this classic cremation urn. CREATED OUT OF DURABLE CULTURED MARBLE: Made in the USA by respected supplier, MacKenzie Vault, our cultured marble cremation urns are both elegant and functional. Each urn is crafted to precise standards from stone, resin, and color pigments to maximize strength and achieve rich color. MARBLE: Take comfort knowing your loved one’s ashes will be laid to rest in a beautiful and durable vessel. Our marble and stone urns are truly timeless. Made of genuine stone and cultured marble, they offer unique marbling designs and shades of color, providing natural beauty in addition to strength. FAMILY-OWNED - Silverlight Urns is a family-owned business that treats you like family. We care about our customers, and we want you to be 100% satisfied with your purchase. We know that buying a memorial item is difficult -- and so important to get right. Silverlight Urns strives to provide peace of mind by offering only quality products that meet or exceed your expectations. You can trust that our team will ship your order on time and handle it with care -- in honor of your loved one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51enk5UEYLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silverlight Urns","source_asin":"B07DX8MTB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DX8MTB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DX8MTB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
