window.products.push({"id":809437,"name":"3FT Tall White Tinsel Christmas Tree, Holiday Decor and Centerpiece, Wooden Stand Painted in White Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TiyyDvE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lee Display's Original White Tinsel Christmas Trees! Decorate for the holidays with shaggy and chic White Tinsel Christmas Trees and start creating your centerpiece Reminiscent of vintage feather trees: Originally developed by Lee Display's CEO, Mark Latino, to have the look and feel of vintage trees made with real feathers from the early 1900s. Solid Tinsel Brush: Lee Display builds each tree using one solid color of tinsel for every row of branches. Creating our classic solid-colored tinsel trees. Holds over 5LBS Ornaments: Branches are made on a thick wire so you can hang almost any ornament. We recommend hanging heavier ornaments closer to the trunk of the tree. Flame Resistant Vinyl Tinsel Brush - Indoor & Outdoor Safe. Decorate indoors as table-top displays and centerpieces or use outdoors without worrying about weather damage. 100% Made in America - Lee Display manufactures the entire tree by hand in the US. With tinsel brush tailor-made, our fabricators build the shape of each tree using our custom-designed 'Branching Machines'. A unique and hands-on process. Stand Included: Wood base comes with all trees smaller than 4FT. 5FT Trees come with a Green metal base. Ships all together in one box. Unlit & Undecorated: Clean, Classic, and Uncomplicated. Tinsel Trees ship without pre-strung lights or ornaments. What arrives is a simple & rustic tree ready to be lit and decorated in your own unique style. We recommend using Mini Christmas String Lights, LED Lights, Incandescent Bulbs, or Fairy Wire Lights for lighting the tree.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TiyyDvE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EST. LEE DISPLAY L D 1902","source_asin":"B076DZXPXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076DZXPXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076DZXPXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
