window.products.push({"id":809486,"name":"ALED LIGHT Curtain Lights, 2 Pack 600(2x300) LED 9.8 X 9.8Ft Curtain String Lights 8 Modes USB Waterproof Outdoor Christmas Light for Bedroom Decorati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fUnYSDeWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【IP65 WATERPROOF & NOT KNOT】- Our fairy string curtains lights are covered with transparent waterproof layer. It improved the waterproof level to IP65, also add the weight of string lights to make it droop naturally, and made it easy to separate them instead of twining and knotting. Perfect fairy lights for indoor and outdoor decorations: wedding, party, home, window, wall, bathroom, bedroom, festival, Christmas decoration, etc. 【8 LIGHTING MODES & TIMER】- The warm white curtain lights have 8 working modes - Combination, In Waves, Sequential, Slo-Glo, Chasing/Flash, Slow Fade, Twinkle/Flash, Steady on. You can choose your favorite mode or set timing function. Softer lights create warm romantic atmosphere for your family at every moment. Widely used for windows, bedroom, home, restaurants, hotels, vacations, commercial buildings, shopping malls, Christmas tree etc. 【USB LED CURTAIN LIGHTS】- 300LED window curtain string lights are designed with USB plugs. USB connection gives it a lot more possibilities, run via USB port. ON/OFF Switch: turn the lights on or off, or adjust the 8 modes without the remote by pressing the button on the USB. Easy and convenient for you to use. 【EASY TO INSTALL & USE SAFELY】- No Assembly required, just simply connect it with USB port and control it with remote controller. This wall hanging fairy lights is Low voltage, cool to touch and not heat up, very safe. It gives brilliant illumination without upsetting your eyes, perfect for family with kids and pets, brighten up the happiness atmosphere indoor and outdoor. 【DIY CURTAIN WIRE STRING LIGHTS】- 2 Pack of 3Mx3M starry fairy string lights with 300 LEDs, totally 600 LEDs, 5000K daylight for a scattered diamond like effect to enhance your exquisite decorations, 4m lead cable, 3m main strand, 10 drop strings. Made of copper wire, soft texture, can be cut freely without affecting the rest, so you can DIY any decoration you like.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fUnYSDeWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALED LIGHT","source_asin":"B081JHTKK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081JHTKK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081JHTKK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
