window.products.push({"id":809538,"name":"Riedel Cappuccino Cups and Saucers, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3152468QHJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This Riedel cappuccino cup and saucer set is produced with the same attention to detail that goes into Riedel's world renowned wine glasses. The cups and saucers are made of lead crystal and feature a unique oval shape, straight sides, and an art deco design with a half moon shaped handle that won't transfer the heat to the hand. The saucers are designed with a subtle indent in the base, that nests the 7 ounce cups, which prevents spilling. Amazon.com In the 1950s Professor Claus Riedel created a glassmaking revolution by crafting wine glasses to enhance the flavor of wines. He emphasized clean, unadorned designs with form following function, and his creations have been placed in collection of museums such as the Museum of Modern Art in New York. This set of two cappuccino cups and saucers is made with the same strict attention to detail and function as Riedel's famous wine glasses. The cups hold a generous seven ounces and the saucers include a subtle indent to secure the cup. Other clever design elements include the solid, half-moon shaped handles that are treated to resist heat and straight sides of the cup to focus the aromas of coffee straight to the drinker. The cups and saucers are crafted of fine lead crystal in Austria and should be hand washed in warm water. --Jeff Dalto","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3152468QHJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riedel","source_asin":"B0009O6ERA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009O6ERA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009O6ERA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":809539,"name":"HIC Meat Tenderizer Ice Cracker Marinating Prep Tool, Double Sided, Heavyweight Aluminum, 8.5-Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UemcXzuIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIC’s Meat Tenderizer and Ice Crusher, with a dual-toothed surface, is specially designed to cut into the muscle fibers of tougher cuts of meat and break them down for a more tender and more consistent texture. This must-have of cooking supplies also cracks ice cubes or block ice into smaller pieces to chill drinks faster and keep foods cold longer, like clams on the half shell, peel and eat shrimp, macaroni or potato salad, condiments, and more. It’s well balanced for efficient use. Tenderizing meat helps elevate otherwise tougher cuts to a higher culinary standard. For best results, trim away excess fat and place meat in the freezer for about 30-minutes to chill, but not long enough to freeze. Chilled cuts work best. Before tenderizing, always place a cutting board under the meat to protect countertops. With a firm pressure, strike the cut with the toothed surface of the mallet, working thicker areas more and thinner areas less. Be careful not to break all the way through the meat. Flip the cut over and work the opposite side. Great for chicken, flank steak, eye round, skirt steak, even cooking rabbit meat and other wild game. Make even more tender braciole, chicken fried steak, cordon bleu, and weinerschnitzel. Always tenderize before adding a marinade or using other special cooking techniques, like brining. Made from heavyweight aluminum, HIC’s Meat Tenderizer and Ice Crusher is durable and strong with a rippled handle for secure grip. Hand wash in warm, soapy water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UemcXzuIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B07VH1VZZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VH1VZZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VH1VZZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":809540,"name":"Ottomanson Home Special Runner Rug Sale Black Modern Circle Design (1'10\"X7'0\") 22 Inch by 7 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Pdn8ZIYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This brand new, durable Home Collection area rug is manufactured in Turkey by one of the world's leading area rugs and carpet manufacturers. Machine woven on Jacquard Looms with 100% nylon pile and non-skid rubber backing. Home Collection offers area rugs and runners with non skid rubber backing. Care instructions: Vacuum and rotate the rug regularly. Remove dried spots immediately by scraping carefully towards the middle of the spot. Do not rub wet spots. Absorb moisture with paper towels, and clean with a damp cloth and mild detergent. Professional carpet cleaning when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Pdn8ZIYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ottomanson","source_asin":"B00TYQZ0UG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TYQZ0UG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TYQZ0UG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
