window.products.push({"id":809573,"name":"Tree Free Greetings LM44994 I Heart American Staffordshire Terriers Ceramic Mug with Full-Sized Handle, 15-Ounce, Black and White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aXXviFM7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tree-Free Greetings strives to use the most eco-friendly materials and processes possible. Printed and assembled in the USA, the Tree-Free Greetings Ceramic Mug with Full-Sized Handle is vibrantly printed with hard to find American Staffordshire Terrier themed art and is great for everyday use. It is reusable, replacing wasteful paper cups that wind up in your local landfill. BPA free and Proposition 65 compliant, this beautiful and durable ceramic mug has a generous full-sized handle, holds 15 ounces of your favorite hot beverage, and comes with a protective gift box. Handwashing is recommended. The 15-ounce Ceramic Mug with Full-Sized Handle makes the perfect gift or souvenir. Save trees and spread joy. Buy a Tree-Free earth-friendly gift today. One of a kind dog, cat and pet themed art from Tree-Free Greetings. Search for more of your favorite pet themed art exclusively on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aXXviFM7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tree-Free Greetings","source_asin":"B00FFTM3QA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FFTM3QA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FFTM3QA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":809574,"name":"Sandicast Gray Wolf Bookends","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yY1C4xPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wow. They look so life-like. Sandicast, Inc. magically captures the inner spirit of the animal kingdom like no other company, making them the premier manufacturer of hand-cast animal sculptures. The company was started in 1981 when artist Sandra Brue realized her dream of combining her artistic talent and her lifelong love of animals. Because of the superb quality of her work, collectors around the world now pursue the demand for Sandicast animal sculptures. Queen Elizabeth and President Clinton are just a few of the many celebrities that have Sandicast animals. Sandra has sculpted more than 400 animals; the Sandicast Collection includes everything from dogs and cats to exotic wildlife. Each piece is hand-cast and hand-painted and virtually comes to life when sparkling glass eyes are inserted. What makes Sandicast unique is the fact that there are not only several sculpture sizes from which to choose (Life Size, Companion Size, Original Size, Mid Size and Small), but also a variety of animal poses available within each breed of dog - Standing, Sitting, Sitting Pretty, Lying, Lying Side, Lying Back and Crouching - each with its own distinctive expression. Sandicast invites you to discover their exquisite collection of hand sculpted animals available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yY1C4xPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandicast","source_asin":"B00187MT0S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00187MT0S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00187MT0S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":809575,"name":"Acrylic Kitchen Organization Set, Kitchen Drawer Organizer for Cake Decorating Letters Dispenser Keepers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812plAXYATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Us? 1-Backward design: with the letters being reversed on the mold,the front of the leter is perfect and smooth surface when popped out.the surface of craftwork will be high transparency.scratch-free,no need to polish. 2-Easy to de-mold: our alphabet mold products are designed for the resin beginners .These silicone resin molds are with smooth and shiny interiors, reducing the need to cut back and polish finished resin items.Just twist the DIY casting molds to push out the pendant after material solidification.easy storage and care. Reversed Resin Casting Alphabet Mold can be used to make colorful and beautiful letters and numbers. Ideal for making unique birthday, Christmas, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Valentine’s Day gifts for families, friends, lover etc. Alphabet Keychains Feel free to add glitters and dry flowers if you want to make resin keychains.Before adding crystal chips and dry flowers, you need to put a layer of thin resin to avoid the air bubbles.Try using a heat gun instead of a torch to pop out air bubbles. Alphabet Magnets After installing the magnet, not only can stick things, but also teach. Enjoy playful moments while learning new things at the same time. Hands-on activities hold their attention longer. How to use: Step 1: Use a mixing stick to stir the resin in the measuring cup. step 2: Use a pointed stick to remove bubbles from the resin. Step 3: Put your favorite accessories into the silicone mold. Step 4: Introduce the resin into the mold. Step 5: Let stand, wait for the resin to completely solidify. Step 6: Remove the resin from the mold and finished.(Please make sure your resin piece is fully cured.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812plAXYATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foyozisun","source_asin":"B08N451FKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N451FKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N451FKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":809576,"name":"Whitmor, Crosshatch Gray, Hanging Shoe Shelves Closet Organizer, 30 Section","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xlAbF8A-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Whitmor's Hanging Shoe Shelves is the perfect shoe storage solution without taking up additional floor space. Created with strong, yet breathable fabric containing reinforced seams for additional strength and support. These hanging shoe shelves have a quick set up; the metal hooks hang from the closet rod or garment rack. With a sturdy steel frame, this hanging shoe shelf will be able to organize and showcase your shoe collection! Easy to clean, just wipe with a damp cloth and towel dry.; ; Brand Name: Whitmor Height: 48 in. Width: 16.5 in. Length: 11.5 in. Material: Fabric Product Type: Hanging Shoe Shelves Number in Package: 1 pk Color: Gray Packaging Type: Boxed Number of Compartments: 30","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xlAbF8A-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whitmor","source_asin":"B08SWVGVZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SWVGVZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SWVGVZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
