window.products.push({"id":809654,"name":"Travel Tea Set with Case, 1 Pot 2 Mini Cups Ceramic Cup 300ML with Heat-Resistant Wooden Handle, Portable Kungfu Tea Cup with Infuser for Office Outdo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711l1kMJNVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE AND FUNCTIONAL - Package included: Teapot *1; Teacups *2; Tea Strainer *1; Travel Bag *1. The travel tea cup can hold about 300ml in total, and it is fairly enough for 10 small cups tea. Teacup: 4.3\" x 3.2’’, Mini teacups:2.3\"x1.5\", Travel Bag: 6.7\" x 5.5\", Capacity: Teapot: 10.6 oz (300ml), Tea Cup: 1.1oz (30ml). Please check the SIZE before order it. SEPARATE STRAINER - The separate filter with many small holes to prevent tea leaves pouring out, very convenient to put the tea drain on the tea lid. And it is very easy to clean the tea leaves. The travel tea set is suitable for brewing black tea, pu-er, oolong, green tea, loose tea leaves, tea bag, full leave tea, especially for a relaxing nightcap,a vacations or on trips. WOODEN HANDLE DESIGN - Solid elm wood is not only heat-proof and anti-scalding, but also looks beautiful. The slightly inclined handle design is more in line with the human biological design of the cup, making it more convenient and comfortable to use. We have tested many times that the glued part of the handle is very durable, so there is no need to worry about falling off. SAFE PACKAGING - The portable travel case comes with a thick foam so that the tea cups are kept tightly in place, which guarantees the safety of the ceramic tea set during transportation or travelling. This gift packing is a very suitable and best gift for bridal, tea fanatic, tea lover, teenagers, friends, family, traveller, tea starter, birthday, holiday gift, mother's day, Christmas, Valentine day. RITUAL RELAXING LIFE - Modern busy life needs a sense of ritual to relax our whole body. Brewing tea is to relax and enjoy the aroma, with every little sip you take, inhaling and exhaling, allowing your stress and to melt away. A cup of tea per day can not only greatly reduce the risk of cancer, but also a very elegant artistic enjoyment. PLEASE CHECK the DIMENSIONS and SIZE firstly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711l1kMJNVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"airogym","source_asin":"B08FC9J5D8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FC9J5D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FC9J5D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
