window.products.push({"id":809810,"name":"TOOLF Expandable Dish Drainer Rack, Adjustable 304 Stainless Steel Dish Rack, Foldable Dish Drying Rack with Removable Cutlery Holder Swivel Drainage ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K17Cw29rS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium 304 Stainless Steel: Made of heavy-duty food grade 304 stainless steel, this dish drainer is highly resistant to rust, corrosion, and scratches. The thicken strong support bar surrounds the rack to prevent deformation and bending, while the shiny polished surface and elegant streamline make it suitable for any kitchen decor and durable for long-term use. Extendable & Foldable: With a smart expandable design, this dish drying rack can fit different sizes of kitchen countertops. When extended, it can hold a large capacity of plates, bowls, cups, glasses, and full sized pots or pans. When closed, it's compact enough to place in the sink or store in a cupboard without taking up much space. Dimensions: (32 to 54)L x 31W x 14H CM. (Not including utensil holder.) Upgrade Cutlery Holder with Bamboo Cover: The utensils holder features a long protruded drainage outlet that leads water directly into the drip tray, and it can be hanged outside the dish rack to save more inside space for storage. With 3 compartments plus a removable bamboo knife block, it can hold more than 60 forks, knives, and spoons separately, keeping knives safe and eco-friendly. 270º Rotatable Spout Efficient Drainage: This dish rack has a 270° swivel fast draining spout with three different positions, allowing water to flow into the sink from any direction. You won't need to worry about water spilling on your counter, and you can place it on the best side to fit your kitchen and sink environment. 5 Non-slip Rubber Feet: The bottom of the dish drainer is covered with 5 anti-slip rubber feet that keep it in balance and stable in place. They prevent slipping and tilting, while protecting your countertop and sink from scratches. Important: If the item you received has any problems, please contact us without hesitation. Be assured that TOOLF will always stand behind our products and promise to provide a satisfactory solution for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K17Cw29rS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOOLF","source_asin":"B0BX2LY6H2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX2LY6H2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX2LY6H2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
