window.products.push({"id":809842,"name":"Memory Foam Pillow, Neck Contour Cervical Orthopedic Pillow for Sleeping Side Back Stomach Sleeper, Ergonomic Bed Pillow for Neck Pain - Orange, Firm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GpdEqZA4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our memory foam pillows are ultra comfortable, supportive pillows that are designed to the unique shape of your head to help you slip into a deeper, sounder, more long-lasting sleep to keep you feeling happier and healthier during the day. Why you need Anvo memory foam pillow? 1.Millions+ happy customers 2.100-night free trial 3.Slow rebound memory foam cervical sleeping pillow 4.CertiPUR-US Certified Memory Foam 5.Natural support with ergonomic design 6.Cooling ice silk pillowcase 7.Relieve Shoulder Stiffness 8.Two height option cater for side, back and stomach sleepers 9.Easy care outer cover machine washable 10.Perfect gift for your loved people Ergonomics Design The neck pillow has a special shape which fits the contours of your neck and head. It gives you good support and your head and neck feel gently hugged by the pillow, without uncomfortable feeling. Let your stress and fatigue melt away in deep sleep. Super comfortable cooling ice silk pillow cover The orthopedic bed pillow is encased by a breathable pillow case with a high quality hidden zipper. The pillow case is removable and machine washable for easy cleaning care Slow-rebound Memory Foam Made from CertiPUR-US certified memory foam, the core doesn’t contain any harmful ingredients. The 3-5 seconds slow rebound memory foam adjusts to the natural curve of your body, providing you stress-free sleep. And it never loses its shape even after months of use. Stop letting neck aches prevent you from living life to the fullest. Anvo memory foam pillow is guaranteed to eliminate neck and back pain, improve your life quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GpdEqZA4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anvo","source_asin":"B085Y4VSNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085Y4VSNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085Y4VSNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
