window.products.push({"id":809889,"name":"Foundations Lullaby Rocking Glider Chair, Wood, Natural/Blue, Adult","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719xHOfsv3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Ease on back and take a rest in the Lullaby Rocking Glider Chair. This lightweight glider is only 37 lbs. which makes it an easy piece of furniture to move in a nursery or bedroom. Very safe for one person to move at a time. The soft cushions that are on the back of the chair make sitting down very manageable and relaxing. Additionally, there is a recliner option which makes a quick sleep smooth and easy. While rocking, the safe and sturdy base is reliable to not tip over easily. Make sure to rest and relax into a sweet lullaby with the Rocking Glider Chair. Constructive Playthings is committed to providing safe, compliant products and a healthy, safe working environment worldwide. Constructive Playthings fully complies with the CPSIA and works closely with our suppliers and third party, CPSC approved laboratories to ensure we meet regulatory requirements. We require that all products meet all applicable federal regulations, which we review on a continuous basis From the Manufacturer Lullaby Adult Glider Rocker 4201046 (Natural and Blue). The Lullaby Adult Glider Rocker is a traditional glider rocker which features a wood base that has a durable gliding mechanism and is tip resistant for comfort and peace of mind. Features high quality construction, high density foam and spring reinforced seating which will provide years of reliable use at a great value. High quality fabric enables seat cover and side panels to be removed for laundering. Side panel also features deep pocket to allow caregiver to keep necessities within arm's reach. Full one year, no hassle warranty. Foundations uses only wood certified to having been harvested with safe and responsible forestry practices and all products comply with the PEFC certification seal. Rocker set up dimensions: 40'' High X 25'' Wide X 26'' Long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719xHOfsv3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foundations","source_asin":"B005I1VMC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-809889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005I1VMC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005I1VMC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
